!Sample_characteristics_ch1 = treatment: no
!Sample_treatment_protocol_ch1 = CD8 T cells were added to KPC cells in vitro or injected into tumor-bearing mice
!Sample_growth_protocol_ch1 = KPC were culture in IMDM or transplanted orthotopically into the pancreas of mice
!Sample_molecule_ch1 = polyA RNA
!Sample_extract_protocol_ch1 = RNA was extracted using the Qiagen RNeasy Kit, DNA was extracted using the Qiagen Maxi Cell and Tissue Kit. RNA libraries were prepared for sequencing using standard Illumina protocols, for CRISPR screen standard PCR of the sgRNA cassette with Illumina adapters was done
!Sample_description = Gene expression
!Sample_description = rawCounts.txt
!Sample_data_processing = Illumina RTA3 software used for basecalling.
!Sample_data_processing = Sequenced reads were trimmed for adaptor sequence, and filtered for low-complexity or low-quality sequence, then mapped to mm10 whole genome using HISAT2 with parameters hisat2 -x; for sgRNA cassettes, sequences were mapped to the Brie library using MAGeCK 0.5.9 with parameters mageck count -l reference_library.txt
!Sample_data_processing = RNA-Seq: raw count matrix was generated in R Studio using the Rsubread package with the featureCounts function
!Sample_data_processing = RNA-Seq: Differential Gene expression was assessed using the R package edgeR
!Sample_data_processing = CRISPR Screen: Enriched/Depleted sgRNAs were analysed with MAGeCK 0.5.9 with the parameter mageck test -k .count_normalized.txt -t OT-1 -c CTRL --norm-method control --control-sgrna sgRNActrl.txt
!Sample_data_processing = Genome_build: mm10
